message.content:
Below is a **complete “starter kit”** you can copy‑paste into your own repo and run locally.  
It contains:

| Layer | Tech stack |
|-------|------------|
| Backend | **Node + Express + Typescript**, `sequelize` ORM → **PostgreSQL** |
| Frontend | **React + Vite + TS** + **Material‑UI** + **Leaflet** (map & routing) |
| Auth | JSON Web Tokens (JWT) – stateless login |
| Deployment | Docker / Docker‑Compose |

> ⚠️ *This is a **minimal viable product** (MVP).*  
> Add more features (e.g., real‑time geofencing, advanced analytics, PDF invoicing…) as you grow.

---

## 1️⃣ Project layout

```
trucking-tms/
├─ backend/
│   ├─ src/
│   │   ├─ controllers/
│   │   ├─ middleware/
│   │   ├─ models/
│   │   ├─ routes/
│   │   └─ utils/
│   ├─ .env.example
│   ├─ tsconfig.json
│   └─ package.json
└─ frontend/
    ├─ public/
    ├─ src/
    │   ├─ api/
    │   ├─ app/
    │   ├─ assets/
    │   ├─ components/
    │   ├─ pages/
    │   └─ store/
    ├─ vite.config.ts
    ├─ index.html
    └─ package.json
docker-compose.yml
README.md
